{
  "uniqueId": "modelservice-1788357329979001029",
  "name": "claude-fable-5-1",
  "displayName": "Claude Fable 5.1",
  "provider": "Anthropic",
  "description": "Claude Fable 5.1 improves on Claude Fable 5 across the board, with the biggest gains in agentic coding, long-running agentic workflows, and knowledge work: long code refactors, front-end and visual code generation, and finance and analysis tasks in particular. It also tends to be more concise than Fable 5 in its plans and summaries. We recommend testing it as a direct upgrade wherever you use Fable 5 today, and alongside Opus 5 on reasoning-heavy tasks.",
  "zhDescription": "Claude Fable 5.1 在 Claude Fable 5 的基础上实现了全面升级，其中智能体编程、长程智能体工作流及知识工作能力提升尤为显著，尤其擅长大型代码重构、前端与可视化代码生成，以及金融和分析类任务。与 Fable 5 相比，它在制定计划和生成摘要时也更加简洁。建议在当前使用 Fable 5 的场景中将其作为直接升级版本进行测试，并在高强度推理任务中与 Opus 5 搭配评估。",
  "longDescription": "Claude Fable 5.1 improves on Claude Fable 5 across the board, with the biggest gains in agentic coding, long-running agentic workflows, and knowledge work: long code refactors, front-end and visual code generation, and finance and analysis tasks in particular. It also tends to be more concise than Fable 5 in its plans and summaries. We recommend testing it as a direct upgrade wherever you use Fable 5 today, and alongside Opus 5 on reasoning-heavy tasks.",
  "zhLongDescription": "Claude Fable 5.1 在 Claude Fable 5 的基础上实现了全面升级，其中智能体编程、长程智能体工作流及知识工作能力提升尤为显著，尤其擅长大型代码重构、前端与可视化代码生成，以及金融和分析类任务。与 Fable 5 相比，它在制定计划和生成摘要时也更加简洁。建议在当前使用 Fable 5 的场景中将其作为直接升级版本进行测试，并在高强度推理任务中与 Opus 5 搭配评估。",
